<title>KENYA: SOCCER-KENYA BEAT GABON 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KENYA BEAT GABON 1-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya beat Gabon 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0) in an African Nations Cup group 5 first-leg qualifier on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Michael Muiruri 70</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
</text>
